[{"id":162401323,"discussion_id":"8e94b22437a93121198292f0662d0c7bc32af5bd","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| conversion/im2col | ✅ [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong), [*wangrui_*](https://gitcode.com/wangrui_) (2/2) | ✅ [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-02-06T08:53:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-09T11:40:47+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162401326,"discussion_id":"4fed21518131f93fcbb1c6c14816b9f163533b02","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-06T08:53:44+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T08:53:44+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162401328,"discussion_id":"5a5c08c086fbda55c84c596ecc32a58b3cc10311","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复了在特定数据类型（int8）下，im2col算子数据收集（Gather）后存储操作中掩码（Mask）使用不当的问题。原代码在处理int8类型数据时，由于需要将B16格式数据打包为B8格式，使用了不匹配的掩码进行对齐存储，可能导致数据写入越界或覆盖相邻数据，影响计算结果的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在 `CalcIdxAndGather` 函数中，针对int8数据类型（`sizeof(T) == sizeof(int8_t)`）的处理分支，新增了一个与 `wUbFactor` 对齐的掩码变量 `maskT`。在调用 `StoreAlign` 存储打包后的数据时，将原来使用的 `maskOut` 掩码替换为 `maskT`，确保存储操作的掩码范围与目标数据类型（int8）的数据量严格匹配，从而消除了潜在的存储越界风险。","created_at":"2026-02-06T08:53:55+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T08:53:55+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162401479,"discussion_id":"b6ff165b9776b68f44e7f79fb87d1648d0bfdcbf","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-06T08:58:24+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T08:58:24+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162484282,"discussion_id":"f415232cc00a63dcd7f5d2d6a97badff029d2187","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n pengyiming7, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-02-06T17:20:08+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T17:20:08+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","obj